      "title": "New delete endpoints have no tests",
      "description": "The change adds two delete endpoints with new auth and error paths. The repository contains no test that exercises them. Regressions in access control or purge error handling will go unnoticed. Add tests for the unauthorized delete, the purge with an unknown id, and the purge count.",
